//   mA, mB: detail fbm channel at the 173 m / 47 m scales (~0.5 +- 0.1): the samples at
//   rot2( xz, 0.7 ) / 173 and rot2( xz, 2.1 ) / 47 that the terrain takes anyway; slope: 1 - N.y;
